---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const APP = "https://login.ollastack.com";

const sections = [
  { id: "what", title: "What projects are" },
  { id: "create", title: "Create a project" },
  { id: "file", title: "File forms + mailboxes" },
];
---

<Base current="docs" title="Docs — Projects — Ollastack" description="Group forms and agent mailboxes into projects — one tidy workspace per client, product, or environment, with file uploads on presigned storage." docsName="Projects" docsSlug="projects">
  <div class="docs-shell container-wide">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="side-eyebrow mono">/ docs / projects</div>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          {sections.map((s) => (
            <li><a href={`#${s.id}`}>{s.title}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="side-back"><a href="/docs">← Back to docs</a></div>
    </aside>

    <article class="content">
      <span class="chip mono"><span class="dot"></span>projects</span>
      <h1 class="display">Group forms and mailboxes by client or app.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Projects are a lightweight folder inside an organization. File your forms
        and agent mailboxes under a project — one per client, product, or
        environment — and filter the dashboard down to just that work.
      </p>

      <h2 id="what">What projects are</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>A named grouping that lives in an <a href="/docs/teams">organization</a>.</li>
        <li>Forms and agent mailboxes can each be <em>filed into</em> one project (or none).</li>
        <li>Filing is non-destructive: removing a project unfiles its content, never deletes it.</li>
        <li>Great for agencies (a project per client) or teams running many forms (a project per app/environment).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="create">Create a project</h2>
      <pre class="code"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="k">curl</span> -X POST {APP}/api/orgs/<span class="hl">&lt;orgId&gt;</span>/projects \
     -H <span class="s">"Cookie: ollastack_session=…"</span> -H <span class="s">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \
     -d <span class="s">'&#123; "name": "Acme Inc." &#125;'</span></pre>
      <p>
        Member access required (viewers can see projects but not change them).
        List them with <code>GET /api/orgs/&#123;orgId&#125;/projects</code>.
      </p>

      <h2 id="file">File forms + mailboxes</h2>
      <p>
        Set <code>projectId</code> on a form or mailbox to file it; set it to
        <code>null</code> to unfile. The project must belong to the same org as
        the content.
      </p>
      <pre class="code"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="k">curl</span> -X PATCH {APP}/api/forms/<span class="hl">&lt;formId&gt;</span> \
     -H <span class="s">"Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;"</span> -H <span class="s">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \
     -d <span class="s">'&#123; "projectId": "&lt;projectId&gt;" &#125;'</span></pre>
      <p>
        In the dashboard, use the project picker on a form or mailbox to do the
        same, then filter the list by project.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href={`${APP}/dashboard/orgs`}>Open your orgs</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/docs">Back to docs</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .docs-shell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 56px; padding: 64px 28px 96px; }
  .sidebar { position: sticky; top: 80px; align-self: start; }
  .side-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .sidebar nav ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .sidebar nav a { display: block; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .sidebar nav a:hover { background: var(--bg-sunken); color: var(--ink); }
  .side-back { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; }
  .side-back a { color: var(--muted); }
  .content { max-width: 760px; }
  .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .chip .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; }
  .content h1 { font-size: 44px; margin: 0 0 14px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.05; }
  .content h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 48px 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
  .content .lede { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 620px; }
  .content p { line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .content ul { line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .content code { background: var(--bg-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9em; }
  .code { background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--code-fg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; margin: 8px 0 14px; }
  .code .prompt { color: var(--code-prompt); margin-right: 8px; }
  .code .k { color: var(--code-cmd); font-weight: 600; }
  .code .s { color: var(--code-str); }
  .code .hl { color: var(--accent); }
  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .docs-shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sidebar { position: static; } }
</style>
